{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/uxrqvk","slideIndex":1,"text":"主题提案，故事与视觉均为原创设计建议，尚未确定为最终游戏设定。\n图片为内置 image_gen 生成的概念图，不是游戏截图，也不是可直接导入的模型或材质。\n生成提示词：Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: visual material and modeling reference board for game art. A single cohesive wide 16:9 studio tabletop composition on a deep grey-blue neutral background showing the asset family of a stopped clockwork citadel: a modular stone pointed arch and wall fragment behind, a brass piston and pipe elbow, an exposed gear and riveted steel maintenance grating in the foreground, an old copper pressure-gauge rivet carbine and small mechanical heart relic, a standing slim armored clockwork sentinel. Beside props lie visible natural sample chunks of chipped basalt stone, aged yellow brass and oxidized metal. All items well separated spatially, clearly modeled and lit, no labeled cards or UI, no typography or text, no logos. Painterly game concept art with believable material roughness, cyan tiny glowing channels and amber warm rim light. Original designs for style reference, not ready-made usable assets.\n\n素材搜集要求：优先可拼接建筑模块，检查底部枢轴、统一厘米尺度、UV、简单碰撞与可步行面。角色需要骨骼、基础待机/移动/受击动画，武器需要独立可拆部件。PBR贴图至少包括Base Color、Normal、Roughness、AO，金属件另需Metallic，能源或灯具另需Emissive遮罩。建议首版采用2K可平铺材质及独立贴花。按项目使用范围核对授权和来源，保持同一写实或风格化程度。关键词用于检索素材类型，不指向已验证的具体商品。\n\nP1 氛围扩展：旗帜、仪表、小型蒸汽特效。先用静态配重表现停摆。\n配色：灰蓝石材 #343D49, 旧黄铜 #A67C45, 青蓝能源 #54C7CC, 琥珀奖励 #E8AF54\n核心材质：石砖、黄铜、钢板。奖励用琥珀色，危险预警用红橙色。"}
