{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/qugm93","slideIndex":2,"text":"主题提案，故事与视觉均为原创设计建议，尚未确定为最终游戏设定。\n图片为内置 image_gen 生成的概念图，不是游戏截图，也不是可直接导入的模型或材质。\n生成提示词：Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: game art direction presentation, cinematic environment concept. Landscape 16:9 painterly 3D fantasy FPS concept art for a castle that consumes memories. A vast Gothic portrait gallery leading to a circular throne hall, pointed arches and ribbed vaults, worn limestone, black crystalline growths inside broken framed portraits, deep burgundy velvet torn banners, warm candle clusters, muted violet spectral trails, pale faceless armored court guard on the right for scale, a restrained royal silhouette emerges from a painted portrait. Steps, ramps, balconies and cover clearly readable for gameplay. Charcoal #211D28, limestone #A99D88, burgundy #6F263C, candle gold #DCA85A, spectral lavender #A89BD4. Melancholic and mysterious, sophisticated stylized fantasy, readable detail, no gore. Cinematic wide environmental frame. No text, labels, logos, watermark, HUD. Original conceptual art.\n\n素材搜集要求：优先可拼接建筑模块，检查底部枢轴、统一厘米尺度、UV、简单碰撞与可步行面。角色需要骨骼、基础待机/移动/受击动画，武器需要独立可拆部件。PBR贴图至少包括Base Color、Normal、Roughness、AO，金属件另需Metallic，能源或灯具另需Emissive遮罩。建议首版采用2K可平铺材质及独立贴花。按项目使用范围核对授权和来源，保持同一写实或风格化程度。关键词用于检索素材类型，不指向已验证的具体商品。\n\nP1 氛围扩展：漂浮字迹、画像褪色、晶体微光。首版用静态贴图讲故事。"}
